OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F311A1785887271
OL,3,CMore than 150 migrants rescued after
OL,4,Cdinghy capsizes in English Channel
OL,6,FA dinghy carrying 157 migrants has
OL,7,Fcapsized in the English Channel after
OL,8,Fits engine caught fire at sea.
OL,10,FThey were rescued from the water by
OL,11,FFrench vessels aided by two British
OL,12,FBorder Security Command boats and a
OL,13,FRLNI lifeboat, and are being taken to
OL,14,FBoulogne-sur-Mer, French authorities
OL,15,Fsaid.
OL,17,FA Maritime and Coastguard Agency told
OL,18,FITV News: "A vessel caught fire
OL,19,Fearlier this morning whilst in the
OL,20,FFrench search and rescue region. UK
OL,21,Fvessels and a lifeboat are assisting."
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/8
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
