OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,312,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31102
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F311A1785887271
OL,3,CMore than 150 migrants rescued after
OL,4,Cdinghy capsizes in English Channel
OL,6,FA total of 54 migrants were taken to
OL,7,FFrance on the British vessels.
OL,9,FIn relation to the incident, a UK
OL,10,FGovernment spokesperson said: "This
OL,11,Fmorning, the Border Security Command
OL,12,Fwas alerted to an incident in the
OL,13,FChannel concerning a migrant small
OL,14,Fboat in distress in French waters.
OL,16,F"British vessels supported a French
OL,17,Fsearch and rescue operation. This is a
OL,18,Flive rescue operation but at this
OL,19,Fstage there have been no fatalities
OL,20,Freported. Those on board will be
OL,21,Fsafely returned to France.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/8
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,312,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31103
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F311A1785887271
OL,3,CMore than 150 migrants rescued after
OL,4,Cdinghy capsizes in English Channel
OL,6,F"This incident underlines the terrible
OL,7,Fdangers of small boat crossings. We
OL,8,Fcontinue to work relentlessly with the
OL,9,FFrench and our partners overseas to
OL,10,Fprevent these perilous journeys."
OL,12,FIn a translated statement, French
OL,13,Fauthorities said the decision was
OL,14,Finitially made not to force the
OL,15,Fmigrants to board rescue vessels to
OL,16,F"avoid endangering their lives".
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/8
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
