OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F311A1785887271
OL,3,CMore than 150 migrants rescued after
OL,4,Cdinghy capsizes in English Channel
OL,6,FThe number of people on the boat,
OL,7,Fwhich left the beach at Veules-les-
OL,8,FRoses, near Dieppe, on Monday night,
OL,9,Fmakes it one of the biggest ever to
OL,10,Fattempt to cross the Channel.
OL,12,FAn RNLI spokesperson said Eastbourne's
OL,13,Fall-weather lifeboat launched at 6am
OL,14,Fon Tuesday.
OL,16,FMore than 2,000 people have crossed
OL,17,Fthe English Channel in small boats
OL,18,Fsince Andy Burnham became Prime
OL,19,FMinister.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/8
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
