OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F311A1785887271
OL,3,CMore than 150 migrants rescued after
OL,4,Cdinghy capsizes in English Channel
OL,6,FThe latest figures show 326 migrants
OL,7,Farrived on Saturday in four boats,
OL,8,Fbringing the number up to 2,057 since
OL,9,FBurnham took over from Sir Keir
OL,10,FStarmer on July 20.
OL,12,FThere were 1,962 crossings in the same
OL,13,Fperiod last year, with the total for
OL,14,Fthe year so far having dropped
OL,15,Fsignificantly compared with this time
OL,16,Fin 2025.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/8
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
