PN,31106
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F311A1785887271
OL,3,CMore than 150 migrants rescued after
OL,4,Cdinghy capsizes in English Channel
OL,6,FBurnham has said the government's plan
OL,7,Fto curb Channel crossings is working
OL,8,Fas numbers are down year-on-year,
OL,9,Fadding that the number of crossings is
OL,10,Fdown 50% this year compared with the
OL,11,Fsame period in 2025.
OL,13,FThe PM added that July crossings were
OL,14,Fat their lowest in six years, but
OL,15,Fadmitted there is more to do.
OL,17,FSubscribe for free to our weekly
OL,18,Fnewsletter for exclusive and original
OL,19,Fcoverage from ITV News. Direct to your
OL,20,Finbox every Friday morning.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/8
