OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,312,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31107
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F311A1785887271
OL,3,CMore than 150 migrants rescued after
OL,4,Cdinghy capsizes in English Channel
OL,6,FDuring a visit on Dover to tout a
OL,7,Fboost to the number of officers
OL,8,Fdeployed to tackle smuggling gangs,
OL,9,FBurnham said he wanted to "grip" the
OL,10,Fissue of small boat arrivals rather
OL,11,Fthen "play politics" with it.
OL,13,F"The public don't like the idea that
OL,14,Fthe border looks like it's not
OL,15,Fcontrolled," he said.
OL,17,FAdding: "We need to bring back that
OL,18,Fcontrol, but also we need to offer
OL,19,Fsupport for people who genuinely need
OL,20,Fit.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G7/8
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,312,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31108
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F311A1785887271
OL,3,CMore than 150 migrants rescued after
OL,4,Cdinghy capsizes in English Channel
OL,6,F"Slowly but surely we are putting in
OL,7,Fplace those building blocks of a very
OL,8,Fdifferent approach to this issue. It's
OL,9,Fworking, but there's more to be done."
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G8/8
